== Thread Z: VSI with a stochastic human (model (ii): deterministic core + memoryless deviations) ==
   M = 6 insight types, q = 256 values, n0 = 12, slack 6 (n = 18); T = 60 problems per seed;
   seeds 1..30 (30); K = M log2(q n0) = 69.5 bits; rerun cap 60;
   sampler: m = 30 runs before a demonstration.  Numbers are means over seeds.
   'rejections' counts rejected runs (for CI: failed outputs, since CI has no verifier);
   'q/rej' is task queries per rejection (for the sampler: per demonstration, see 'demos').

